-DATASET CSV empty

--

-CASE ProjectionRepeatsDiscardedOrderByKey
-LOOP i 1 2000
-STATEMENT UNWIND [10, 20, NULL, 5] AS x WITH x ORDER BY x + x SKIP 0 RETURN x + x AS y
-CHECK_ORDER
---- 4
10
20
40

-STATEMENT UNWIND [10, 20, NULL, 5] AS x WITH x ORDER BY x * x SKIP 0 RETURN x * x AS y
-CHECK_ORDER
---- 4
25
100
400

-ENDLOOP
